+## 9. Artifact preview scope invariant
+
+Conversation artifact cards open only through `StudioViewModel` and the real
+`ArtifactService.readContent()` authorization path. The accessor scope is
+captured from the active workspace/project/session at open time. A late read
+cannot update a different session or a different project, because the
+presentation request token and live scope are both rechecked before state
+commit. Unsupported/binary artifacts remain explicitly unpreviewed rather
+than being decoded or represented as fabricated content.
+
+`ChatAdaptiveLayout` gives the artifact surface the lowest pane priority:
+sessions first, context second, artifact third. The artifact becomes a
+dedicated pane only when the remaining width preserves the existing minimum
+chat column; otherwise it becomes a sheet.
